# Git HOL 4 Notes

## Merge Conflict

A merge conflict occurs when two branches modify the same part of a file differently.

## Resolution

- Identify the conflict.
- Edit the file manually.
- Remove conflict markers.
- Stage the file.
- Commit the resolved merge.

## Key Learning

- Conflicts are resolved manually.
- Git highlights conflicting sections.
- After resolving, the merge must be committed.